{"server":"cn","storyId":"main_9_level_main_09-12_beg","groupId":"main_9","stageId":"main_09-12","title":"风中旗帜","storyCode":"9-14","avgTag":"行动前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_09-12_beg.txt","sourceHash":"d069baeda356aa891bb8ca5c5438d8962557acc8fce6d5c7e4ca4000e3badb59","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_windows"},{"type":"narration","text":"5:57 P.M. 天气/雨\n小丘郡 第十区附近空屋"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"重症感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_232","isRemote":false,"text":"......唔......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Outcast","speakerId":"avg_npc_245_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你醒了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Outcast","speakerId":"avg_npc_245_1","isRemote":false,"text":"考虑到你的心肺受了一定损伤，就连呼吸都将给你带来剧烈的疼痛，我建议你别费力开口。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"重症感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_232","isRemote":false,"text":"咳，咳咳......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Outcast","speakerId":"avg_npc_245_1","isRemote":false,"text":"腹部几乎被撕裂了......伤势比我预想的还严重。是什么让你活了下来？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Outcast","speakerId":"avg_npc_245_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊哈......我并非专业医师，但我也对各个种族的生理结构有些了解。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Outcast","speakerId":"avg_npc_245_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我的同事把你认作瓦伊凡，这不怪他，他太年轻，未曾见过你们祖先盘踞在这片土地上的庞大身影。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"重症感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_232","isRemote":false,"text":"呃唔——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Outcast","speakerId":"avg_npc_245_1","isRemote":false,"text":"少点激动，对你的身体没好处。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Outcast","speakerId":"avg_npc_245_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我见过你的法术，也做了一些小小的准备，你想在这间屋子里点火的话，恐怕不太容易。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"重症感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_232","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Outcast","speakerId":"avg_npc_245_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的表情很有趣。发现没法攻击我之后，你竟然感到了放松？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Outcast","speakerId":"avg_npc_245_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这甚至比你的自卫反应还要自然——也许这才是你内心深处更真实的情绪？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"重症感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_232","isRemote":false,"text":"不......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Outcast","speakerId":"avg_npc_245_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看来否认已成为你的习惯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Outcast","speakerId":"avg_npc_245_1","isRemote":false,"text":"被迫成为不想成为的人，你的痛苦显而易见。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Outcast","speakerId":"avg_npc_245_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是谁在利用你？到处伸手的赞助者，高塔上的阴影，还是渴望复国的遗民？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Outcast","speakerId":"avg_npc_245_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，不可能。一支完全由傀儡率领的队伍，还不至于能在伦蒂尼姆的监视下这般迅速地崛起。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Outcast","speakerId":"avg_npc_245_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Outcast","speakerId":"avg_npc_245_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你......是被推到台前来的影子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Outcast","speakerId":"avg_npc_245_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这是不是说明，那个提线的人，拥有和你一模一样的血脉？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"重症感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_232","isRemote":false,"text":"不要......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Outcast","speakerId":"avg_npc_245_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你希望我不要说下去？仅仅听到这个人被提起，你就如此恐惧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Outcast","speakerId":"avg_npc_245_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也对，不光是你，整个维多利亚......不，整片大地都该为此感到恐惧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Outcast","speakerId":"avg_npc_245_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她大概和你一样年轻，可在这么短的时间内，她就把那些想要利用她的力量尽数反握在了手中。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Outcast","speakerId":"avg_npc_245_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这么看，变化会比预料的来得更快啊......我们得早做打算。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"重症感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_232","isRemote":false,"text":"你们......拉特......兰......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Outcast","speakerId":"avg_npc_245_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不必猜测我的动机。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Outcast","speakerId":"avg_npc_245_1","isRemote":false,"text":"当决定救你时，我并不在乎你的身份。现在我猜到了，我的想法依旧不会变。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"重症感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_232","isRemote":false,"text":"你......是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Outcast","speakerId":"avg_npc_245_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你最好不知道我是谁。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Outcast","speakerId":"avg_npc_245_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等你恢复行动能力，离开这个地方，也请永远不要向任何人提起是谁救了你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Outcast","speakerId":"avg_npc_245_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不会让你在这里死去，你只需要知道这一点就行。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"重症感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_232","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"重症感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_232","isRemote":false,"text":"好......谢......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Outcast","speakerId":"avg_npc_245_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也别急着道谢。我能做到的只有帮你清创和止血。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Outcast","speakerId":"avg_npc_245_1","isRemote":false,"text":"伤到你的是感染性最强的活性源石，大量源石颗粒已经顺着创口进入了你的血液循环系统。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Outcast","speakerId":"avg_npc_245_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我给你注射了阻断剂，但恐怕还是无法阻止源石结晶在你的内脏和皮肤上形成。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Outcast","speakerId":"avg_npc_245_1","isRemote":false,"text":"很快你会再次在高烧中昏迷，这是好事，至少能减轻急性发作期带来的由内而外的剧痛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Outcast","speakerId":"avg_npc_245_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你可能会无意识地咳血，我会尽量把你的头部垫得高一些，以免你被自己的呕吐物呛死。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"重症感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_232","isRemote":false,"text":"......唔......嗯......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Outcast","speakerId":"avg_npc_245_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你将受到的折磨还远不止此。以后你无法回到过去的生活中了。矿石病将彻底改变你的命运。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Outcast","speakerId":"avg_npc_245_1","isRemote":false,"text":"曾经跟随你的人会离你而去，甚至转过身来仇视你、唾弃你。你很难再领导你的战士，也很难让你的同胞接纳你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"重症感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_232","isRemote":false,"text":"......哈......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Outcast","speakerId":"avg_npc_245_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦？这个表情又一次出现。属于矿石病患者的未来并没有令你绝望，反而令你感到释然？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Outcast","speakerId":"avg_npc_245_1","isRemote":false,"text":"难怪。炮火再怎么猛烈突然，也不至于能把一条年轻的红龙毫无反抗地钉穿在地。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Outcast","speakerId":"avg_npc_245_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你渴望挣脱原本的命运，而少有反抗不需要付出代价。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Outcast","speakerId":"avg_npc_245_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我刚刚有一点想错了——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Outcast","speakerId":"avg_npc_245_1","isRemote":false,"text":"或许你不像你的同族那般贪婪好斗，但你还是保有他们的执着与勇毅。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"重症感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_232","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Outcast","speakerId":"avg_npc_245_1","isRemote":false,"text":"睡吧，别再强撑了。我在你旁边守着你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"重症感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_232","isRemote":false,"text":"危......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"重症感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_232","isRemote":false,"text":"......险......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"重症感染者","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"............"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Outcast","speakerId":"avg_npc_245_1","isRemote":false,"text":"守着你会有危险？昏迷前的一瞬间，你挣扎着想告诉我这个？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Outcast","speakerId":"avg_npc_245_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Outcast","speakerId":"avg_npc_245_1","isRemote":false,"text":"确实。这周围过于安静了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Outcast","speakerId":"avg_npc_245_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你对他们来说，恐怕不是弃卒那么简单。看来，计划得变一变了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Outcast","speakerId":"avg_npc_245_1","isRemote":false,"text":"虽然冒险，但罗德岛也需要你带去的情报......凯尔希会理解的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"21_G4_victoria_street_d_ruins"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_244","isRemote":false,"text":"......报告，没有找到。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“强盗”","speakerId":"avg_npc_234","isRemote":false,"text":"废物！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“强盗”","speakerId":"avg_npc_234","isRemote":false,"text":"连个人都看不住，你们这群人有什么用！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_244","isRemote":false,"text":"对、对不起！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“纵火家”","speakerId":"avg_npc_247","isRemote":false,"text":"你们确实看到她受伤倒下了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_244","isRemote":false,"text":"是......我手下的哨兵亲眼看见的，炮弹落下来的时候，领袖还站在上午行刑的地方附近......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“强盗”","speakerId":"avg_npc_234","isRemote":false,"text":"你也知道那*维多利亚方言粗口*是领袖？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“强盗”","speakerId":"avg_npc_234","isRemote":false,"text":"入伙时说的话你都忘了？敌人一来你就光顾着自己跑？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_244","isRemote":false,"text":"太、太快了，我们都没反应过来......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_244","isRemote":false,"text":"还有，领袖命令我，她要一个人静一静，不许别人靠近......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“强盗”","speakerId":"avg_npc_234","isRemote":false,"text":"那我叫你去死你怎么还不去死？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“强盗”","speakerId":"avg_npc_234","isRemote":false,"text":"还*维多利亚方言粗口*说你不是废物！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“纵火家”","speakerId":"avg_npc_247","isRemote":false,"text":"收手吧，就算当场打死他也没用。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“纵火家”","speakerId":"avg_npc_247","isRemote":false,"text":"我们要确定的是她是死是活，还有现在人在哪里。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“毒药学者”","speakerId":"avg_npc_234","isRemote":false,"text":"......让开......我......来......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“纵火家”","speakerId":"avg_npc_247","isRemote":false,"text":"啧，注意点分寸。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“毒药学者”","speakerId":"avg_npc_234","isRemote":false,"text":"哈......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_244","isRemote":false,"text":"长、长官！饶了我，呜......别......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_244","isRemote":false,"text":"什么......东西......呃啊！呕——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_244","isRemote":false,"text":"哈......哈哈哈......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“毒药学者”","speakerId":"avg_npc_234","isRemote":false,"text":"你看到......她在哪......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_244","isRemote":false,"text":"倒了！倒了！哈哈哈哈哈！倒了！炸穿了！死了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_244","isRemote":false,"text":"死......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“纵火家”","speakerId":"avg_npc_247","isRemote":false,"text":"......这就是你的分寸？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“毒药学者”","speakerId":"avg_npc_234","isRemote":false,"text":"份量......多了......记一......记......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“强盗”","speakerId":"avg_npc_234","isRemote":false,"text":"真*维多利亚方言粗口*恶心，以后我要离你这个拿人试药的变态远一点。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“纵火家”","speakerId":"avg_npc_247","isRemote":false,"text":"好歹我们知道了他没撒谎。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“纵火家”","speakerId":"avg_npc_247","isRemote":false,"text":"她刚刚就在这里倒下的，而且受了重伤，这伤甚至可能致命。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“强盗”","speakerId":"avg_npc_234","isRemote":false,"text":"都受重伤了人还怎么跑？总不能给炸到地底下去了吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“纵火家”","speakerId":"avg_npc_247","isRemote":false,"text":"我不介意把整条街再炸一次。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“强盗”","speakerId":"avg_npc_234","isRemote":false,"text":"......你要炸的话，起码先通知一声啊！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“会计”","speakerId":"avg_npc_234","isRemote":false,"text":"炸街？谁说要炸？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“纵火家”","speakerId":"avg_npc_247","isRemote":false,"text":"别说炸一条街，就算把整座城市都一把火烧干净，我们也得把人找出来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“会计”","speakerId":"avg_npc_234","isRemote":false,"text":"正因为我们之中有你这种和维多利亚军一样愚蠢的人存在，占领这座城市的价值才在急遽缩减。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“纵火家”","speakerId":"avg_npc_247","isRemote":false,"text":"那你们说怎么办？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“纵火家”","speakerId":"avg_npc_247","isRemote":false,"text":"要是让领袖知道她在我们眼皮子底下丢了，这后果谁担得起？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“雄辩家”","speakerId":"avg_npc_246","isRemote":false,"text":"领袖的怒火并非唯一值得畏惧之物。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“雄辩家”","speakerId":"avg_npc_246","isRemote":false,"text":"各位试想一下，在我们许多士兵和合作人士眼中，她即代表了深池。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“雄辩家”","speakerId":"avg_npc_246","isRemote":false,"text":"若是任由她脱离我们的掌控，无论得到她的人是敌人还是某个心怀不轨的“朋友”，后果都不堪设想。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“强盗”","speakerId":"avg_npc_234","isRemote":false,"text":"我*维多利亚方言粗口*想起来，她还......知道我们的全部打算！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“纵火家”","speakerId":"avg_npc_247","isRemote":false,"text":"............"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“纵火家”","speakerId":"avg_npc_247","isRemote":false,"text":"你们说，那两个女人......她们收到这消息了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“会计”","speakerId":"avg_npc_234","isRemote":false,"text":"会议结束她们就离开了，消息应该还没传到她们耳中。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“强盗”","speakerId":"avg_npc_234","isRemote":false,"text":"蔓德拉最不喜欢那家伙，她才不会管。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“纵火家”","speakerId":"avg_npc_247","isRemote":false,"text":"阿赫茉妮......我总是搞不清楚她到底有没有站在我们这边。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“雄辩家”","speakerId":"avg_npc_246","isRemote":false,"text":"注意你的措辞。我们都站在领袖身边。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“强盗”","speakerId":"avg_npc_234","isRemote":false,"text":"爱怎么说怎么说，你们要对阿赫茉妮下手我管不着，蔓德拉是个好姑娘，你们可别想着把她也一块坑进去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“雄辩家”","speakerId":"avg_npc_246","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么会呢，我的朋友？她亦是我们密不可分的好战友。与我们一样，她渴望着在领袖面前彰显才干与忠心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“会计”","speakerId":"avg_npc_234","isRemote":false,"text":"也不知道阿赫茉妮和蔓德拉说了什么，蔓德拉突然变得很听她的话，整个人都兴高采烈的，像是有什么好事发生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“纵火家”","speakerId":"avg_npc_247","isRemote":false,"text":"就是去占个发报机而已，有什么好处能比赶紧打下另一座城市来得实在？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“会计”","speakerId":"avg_npc_234","isRemote":false,"text":"......领袖至今没有对我们的计划表示赞同。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“雄辩家”","speakerId":"avg_npc_246","isRemote":false,"text":"只要我们证明自己没有犯错，就始终有机会说服她。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“强盗”","speakerId":"avg_npc_234","isRemote":false,"text":"那就是说，人我们还是必须要找到咯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“雄辩家”","speakerId":"avg_npc_246","isRemote":false,"text":"即使要翻遍整座城。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“强盗”","speakerId":"avg_npc_234","isRemote":false,"text":"行吧。那也别磨叽了，带人出发啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“会计”","speakerId":"avg_npc_234","isRemote":false,"text":"等等，去叫醒“囚犯”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“强盗”","speakerId":"avg_npc_234","isRemote":false,"text":"啊？我们五个人一起出马，还不够把人抓回来？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“会计”","speakerId":"avg_npc_234","isRemote":false,"text":"别忘了我们的约定，任何功劳都要绝对公平地分配。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“强盗”","speakerId":"avg_npc_234","isRemote":false,"text":"......说什么废话，你就是连同伴都算计。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“强盗”","speakerId":"avg_npc_234","isRemote":false,"text":"这么不想让人通风报信，那这些知道这消息的士兵怎么处理？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“雄辩家”","speakerId":"avg_npc_246","isRemote":false,"text":"自然是先带上，毕竟，找到人之前，人手越多越好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“强盗”","speakerId":"avg_npc_234","isRemote":false,"text":"等找到以后......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“雄辩家”","speakerId":"avg_npc_246","isRemote":false,"text":"我们都很清楚该怎么做。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“雄辩家”","speakerId":"avg_npc_246","isRemote":false,"text":"没人能逃离深池——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“雄辩家”","speakerId":"avg_npc_246","isRemote":false,"text":"也没人能窥见深池的秘密。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"21_G4_victoria_street_d_ruins"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"简妮","speakerId":"avg_479_sleach_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这些绷带必须处理掉——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"志愿者青年","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"可是我已经洗过了啊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"简妮","speakerId":"avg_479_sleach_1","isRemote":false,"text":"洗了也不能用，这一箱物资被已经被地上的源石污染了，我们没法保证粉尘能被完全清洗干净。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"志愿者青年","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，简，我知道你说的都对，但我们的东西真的不够用。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"志愿者青年","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"你看那头，又有好几个受伤严重的被抬过来......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"简妮","speakerId":"avg_479_sleach_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他们是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"志愿者青年","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"您认识他们？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"简妮","speakerId":"avg_479_sleach_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......是的，我......曾经认识。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"简妮","speakerId":"avg_479_sleach_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但我想他们并不想见到我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"简妮","speakerId":"avg_479_sleach_1","isRemote":false,"text":"麻烦你来安置他们吧，我去诊所看看，也许还能找出一点物资。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"志愿者青年","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"简，快看，有人来了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_244","isRemote":false,"text":"快点让开！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"简妮","speakerId":"avg_479_sleach_1","isRemote":false,"text":"............"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"志愿者青年","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"长官，你是来帮我们的吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_244","isRemote":false,"text":"别挡着碍事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"悲伤的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_243","isRemote":false,"text":"等等，你是......罗南？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_244","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_244","isRemote":false,"text":"一个个搜，哪里都别放过！听好了，这附近小巷子多，很容易藏人！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"悲伤的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_243","isRemote":false,"text":"罗南，你在干什么？是我们啊，你怎么换了身衣服就不认识你的邻居和朋友了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_244","isRemote":false,"text":"......我还有重要任务要做，你再拉着我啰嗦的话，别怪我动手了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"悲伤的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_243","isRemote":false,"text":"克雷格受伤了，求你帮帮他吧，看在他一直跟着你做那些事的份上......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_244","isRemote":false,"text":"你说什么胡话？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"悲伤的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_243","isRemote":false,"text":"呜呜......啊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"简妮","speakerId":"avg_479_sleach_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（她背上的伤好重......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"简妮","speakerId":"avg_479_sleach_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（还有，她的孩子，克雷格......他的头部也受了不轻的伤。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"简妮","speakerId":"avg_479_sleach_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（需要尽快给他们止血，可是他们并不欢迎我......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_244","isRemote":false,"text":"都找过了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_244","isRemote":false,"text":"确定没有对得上的人藏在这里？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"简妮","speakerId":"avg_479_sleach_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（他们在找人？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_244","isRemote":false,"text":"......不，不行，这群人乱七八糟地堵在这，要是我们转身走了，又有人混进来，那就不好交代了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"简妮","speakerId":"avg_479_sleach_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（是在找......Outcast去救的人吗？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"简妮","speakerId":"avg_479_sleach_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（那岂不是她会有危险......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"简妮","speakerId":"avg_479_sleach_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（我该走了。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_244","isRemote":false,"text":"喂，你们，站起来，都给我离开这里！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"志愿者青年","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"长官，我们这伤员太多了，大家都没法移动啊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_244","isRemote":false,"text":"没法动也得给我动！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_244","isRemote":false,"text":"来人，把这些矿石病人全部赶出这个街区！小心他们原地炸开，这可比外面那些源石晶簇还要可怕！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_244","isRemote":false,"text":"就比如说，这个满脸是血的小孩子——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克雷格","speakerId":"avg_npc_240","isRemote":false,"text":"呜呜......啊......妈......妈......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"悲伤的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_243","isRemote":false,"text":"克雷格，克雷格！不，你不能带走他，我求你了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"志愿者青年","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"你、你不光见死不救，还想害死他们吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_244","isRemote":false,"text":"说这么难听做什么？大家都是塔拉人，为了塔拉的大业做点牺牲又怎么了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"悲愤的青年","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"罗南，上次你这么说，然后我们就失去了西尔莎！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"简妮","speakerId":"avg_479_sleach_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（......西尔莎？！）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"简妮","speakerId":"avg_479_sleach_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（是这个人......这个人出卖了西尔莎......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"简妮","speakerId":"avg_479_sleach_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（然后他们才把她......把她......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"简妮","speakerId":"avg_479_sleach_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（他用西尔莎的命换来了这身衣服......！）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_244","isRemote":false,"text":"是她辜负了我们的信任......她活该！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_244","isRemote":false,"text":"无法理解领袖伟大和抗争意义的人，都只配得到这个下场——要是你们再这么不配合，下面就轮到你们了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"简妮","speakerId":"avg_479_sleach_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......够了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"志愿者青年","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"简？你......你不是走了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_244","isRemote":false,"text":"你又是什么人？不对啊，我见过你......你不是塔拉人吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"简妮","speakerId":"avg_479_sleach_1","isRemote":false,"text":"请你别再说下去了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"简妮","speakerId":"avg_479_sleach_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没有什么人能轻松地说出那种话。没人有资格替别人决定该为什么牺牲。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_244","isRemote":false,"text":"你手里拿的什么东西......是旗帜？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_244","isRemote":false,"text":"你、你是维多利亚军人！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"简妮","speakerId":"avg_479_sleach_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......维多利亚军人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"简妮","speakerId":"avg_479_sleach_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"简妮","speakerId":"avg_479_sleach_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，我不再是了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"简妮","speakerId":"avg_479_sleach_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只是，如果你执意要践踏这些无辜者的生命，我就是你的敌人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_244","isRemote":false,"text":"......无辜？你知道这些人都干了什么吗，就说他们无辜？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_244","isRemote":false,"text":"这个小孩子，还有这里的每一个人......有谁的手是干净的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"简妮","speakerId":"avg_479_sleach_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那么......你呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"简妮","speakerId":"avg_479_sleach_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你利用了你的同胞来换取地位，又反过来欺压他们......谁来审判你？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_244","isRemote":false,"text":"别再表演你的大义凛然了，想给谁看呢？快，把她赶走！还有这些和维多利亚逃兵混在一起的感染者，围起来，他们都该被清理掉！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"悲伤的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_243","isRemote":false,"text":"求你，帮帮我，帮帮我们......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"简妮","speakerId":"avg_479_sleach_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你不能再往前了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_244","isRemote":false,"text":"你想干什么？快让开！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_244","isRemote":false,"text":"看你走到哪都拿着这破旗子，你根本不是什么有能耐的士兵吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"简妮","speakerId":"avg_479_sleach_1","isRemote":false,"text":"无论我有多少能耐，我都不会让你继续作恶。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_244","isRemote":false,"text":"你的脑子是不是有毛病？他们和你有什么关系？你就这么心甘情愿地被他们利用？你真这么愚蠢吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"简妮","speakerId":"avg_479_sleach_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克雷格","speakerId":"avg_npc_240","isRemote":false,"text":"......呜......哇......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"简妮","speakerId":"avg_479_sleach_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是的，我不会说塔拉语。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"简妮","speakerId":"avg_479_sleach_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我没能真切地体会过你们平时过的生活。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"简妮","speakerId":"avg_479_sleach_1","isRemote":false,"text":"现在我也没得矿石病。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"简妮","speakerId":"avg_479_sleach_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"简妮","speakerId":"avg_479_sleach_1","isRemote":false,"text":"两年多以来，我每天走过你们走的街道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"简妮","speakerId":"avg_479_sleach_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我听见过你们的哭，更看过你们的笑。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"简妮","speakerId":"avg_479_sleach_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我心底始终清楚，我们都是一样的，活生生的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"简妮","speakerId":"avg_479_sleach_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只要是人，就会犯错。犯错的人，该被阻止，该受制裁，该被自己的内心折磨——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"简妮","speakerId":"avg_479_sleach_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是，决定他们命运的人，不该是一个忘恩负义的恶徒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"悲伤的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_243","isRemote":false,"text":"你......你要保护我们？你不恨我们？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"简妮","speakerId":"avg_479_sleach_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼......说一点都不恨......是假的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"简妮","speakerId":"avg_479_sleach_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不会再装作......我们之间毫无隔阂。克雷格也确实做错了事，我无意包庇任何罪恶。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"简妮","speakerId":"avg_479_sleach_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可有人教会了我——眼前的恶，必须被阻止。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"简妮","speakerId":"avg_479_sleach_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这与阵营无关，我本该如此。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"悲伤的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_243","isRemote":false,"text":"谢......谢谢......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克雷格","speakerId":"avg_npc_240","isRemote":false,"text":"......啊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"简妮","speakerId":"avg_479_sleach_1","isRemote":false,"text":"放心吧，克雷格，不用紧抓着我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"简妮","speakerId":"avg_479_sleach_1","isRemote":false,"text":"无论过去我是不是一名合格的战士，在我决定做逃兵的那一刻起，我都已经做好了战斗的准备。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"简妮","speakerId":"avg_479_sleach_1","isRemote":false,"text":"倒是你的伤......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"简妮","speakerId":"avg_479_sleach_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（嘶——）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"简妮","speakerId":"avg_479_sleach_1","isRemote":false,"text":"差点忘了，我身上没什么东西比这面旗子更干净，它的确该有更合适的用处。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"简将撕下来的旗帜一角轻柔地裹上孩子受伤的额头。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克雷格","speakerId":"avg_npc_240","isRemote":false,"text":"呜......对......对不起......姐......姐......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"简妮","speakerId":"avg_479_sleach_1","isRemote":false,"text":"克雷格，先别说这些，你好好睡一觉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"简妮","speakerId":"avg_479_sleach_1","isRemote":false,"text":"至于你，士兵，你该离开这了——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"简妮","speakerId":"avg_479_sleach_1","isRemote":false,"text":"并且，在离开之前，你需要对西尔莎的事作出交代。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_244","isRemote":false,"text":"就你？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"简妮","speakerId":"avg_479_sleach_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就算只有我。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"悲愤的青年","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......还有我们。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"21_I15"},{"type":"narration","text":"伤势较轻的人们从各个角落里站了出来，一个接着一个，聚到了紧握旗帜的简身后。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你们——你们干什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你们是要反抗深池吗？奥布莱恩，你应该跟我一起抓住她，别忘了达米安是怎么死的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"悲愤的青年","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不，罗南，我没忘记达米安，但是......我同样没法忘记西尔莎。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"悲愤的青年","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我们是做了很多错事......我不是瞎子，都到这个时候了，我知道谁才是一直帮我们的那个人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"可她明明不是塔拉人！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"简妮","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你看见大家的眼神了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"简妮","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"至少，在这一刻，我们才是站在一起的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......一群没救的傻子！你们会因为这一刻的愚蠢死在这里！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"简妮","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"大家还是注意伤势，不用勉强。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"简妮","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"这些恶徒请放心交给我吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"简妮","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"这场战斗，我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"简妮","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不，我们一定能赢！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[]}
